OL,3,AUK ethics watchdog chief steps back
OL,4,Afrom role over sexual misconduct claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the government's main
OL,7,Fethics watchdog has stepped back after
OL,8,Fit emerged he was investigated in a
OL,9,Fprevious job over alleged sexual
OL,10,Fmisconduct involving female colleagues,
OL,11,Fand had, in one case, been sanctioned.
OL,13,FStuart Sterling was appointed as the
OL,14,Ffirst chief executive of the newly
OL,15,Fformed Ethics and Integrity Commission
OL,16,Fin October 2025.
OL,18,FThe existence of the allegations
OL,19,Fagainst Sterling, and the
OL,20,Finvestigations into them, were first
OL,21,Freported by the Sunday Times.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
